{"release":{"id":396520353,"tag":"0.7.0","author":"nsakkine","name":"0.7.0","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-09-24T12:42:08Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-25T10:42:29Z","markdown":"## What's Changed\r\n* Fix `DiffusionOutput` to not wrap `videos=None` into a list by @Arech8 in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/771\r\n* fix(sd3,hunyuandit): drop callback pops for undefined negative embeds by @Anai-Guo in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/776\r\n* fix(flux): drop callback pops for nonexistent negative embeds by @Anai-Guo in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/775\r\n* Fix FA3 ring attention argument forwarding by @zjn20030811 in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/774\r\n* [bugfix] take start time of all ranks into account for performance measurements by @Arech8 in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/772\r\n* new MHA v4 features, bugs, fixes by @jcaraban in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/779\r\n* Add determinism check by @Arech8 in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/778\r\n* Enable MiniMax-H3 tile-parallel VAE decode behind --use_parallel_vae by @hakankiymaz-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/777\r\n* FP8 Ulysses All-to-All Communication by @tjkemp in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/753\r\n* FastH3 VSA-H3 T2VA support by @hakankiymaz-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/780\r\n* feat: add MXFP6 GEMM and unified GEMM configuration by @ksikiric in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/782\r\n* Extended FP8 comms support by @pds-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/783\r\n* restore torch<2.10 compute-communication overlap passes by @lauri9 in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/784\r\n* [Fix] Recompiles on Minimax-H3 by @nsakkine in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/781\r\n* fix: skip torchao-quantized linear weights in quantization paths by @pds-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/786\r\n* Extended Wan CFG parallel support by @pds-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/787\r\n* Add FastH3 V2 runner and V1 weight variant aliases by @jjuvonen-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/789\r\n* [Perf] MiniMax-H3: quantize decoded video on device instead of on the host by @jjuvonen-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/790\r\n* Add Lumina-Image-2.0 support with CFG and GQA-aware Ulysses by @lavinal712 in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/785\r\n* feat: support CFG parallelism for Qwen Image Edit by @pds-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/788\r\n* [Perf] LTX2.5: balance decode ranks using tile volume based cost proxy by @lauri9 in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/791\r\n* Enable FP8 communications with AITER MHA v4 by @ksikiric in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/792\r\n* Update CODEOWNERS list by @avjves in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/793\r\n* [Perf] FastH3: faster and compilable VSA-H3 attention by @jjuvonen-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/794\r\n* FastH3 V1 Dense model variant runner support by @jjuvonen-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/796\r\n* [AMD] Let dense AITER MHA v4 backends serve trailing-padded packed sequences by @jjuvonen-amd in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/797\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Anai-Guo made their first contribution in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/776\r\n* @zjn20030811 made their first contribution in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/774\r\n* @lavinal712 made their first contribution in https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/785\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/compare/0.6.0...0.7.0","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix <code>DiffusionOutput</code> to not wrap <code>videos=None</code> into a list by @Arech8 in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/771\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/771</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix(sd3,hunyuandit): drop callback pops for undefined negative embeds by @Anai-Guo in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/776\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/776</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix(flux): drop callback pops for nonexistent negative embeds by @Anai-Guo in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/775\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/775</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix FA3 ring attention argument forwarding by @zjn20030811 in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/774\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/774</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix] take start time of all ranks into account for performance measurements by @Arech8 in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/772\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/772</a>\n</li>\n<li>new MHA v4 features, bugs, fixes by @jcaraban in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/779\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/779</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add determinism check by @Arech8 in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/778\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/778</a>\n</li>\n<li>Enable MiniMax-H3 tile-parallel VAE decode behind --use_parallel_vae by @hakankiymaz-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/777\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/777</a>\n</li>\n<li>FP8 Ulysses All-to-All Communication by @tjkemp in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/753\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/753</a>\n</li>\n<li>FastH3 VSA-H3 T2VA support by @hakankiymaz-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/780\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/780</a>\n</li>\n<li>feat: add MXFP6 GEMM and unified GEMM configuration by @ksikiric in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/782\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/782</a>\n</li>\n<li>Extended FP8 comms support by @pds-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/783\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/783</a>\n</li>\n<li>restore torch&lt;2.10 compute-communication overlap passes by @lauri9 in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/784\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/784</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Fix] Recompiles on Minimax-H3 by @nsakkine in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/781\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/781</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix: skip torchao-quantized linear weights in quantization paths by @pds-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/786\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/786</a>\n</li>\n<li>Extended Wan CFG parallel support by @pds-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/787\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/787</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add FastH3 V2 runner and V1 weight variant aliases by @jjuvonen-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/789\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/789</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Perf] MiniMax-H3: quantize decoded video on device instead of on the host by @jjuvonen-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/790\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/790</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add Lumina-Image-2.0 support with CFG and GQA-aware Ulysses by @lavinal712 in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/785\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/785</a>\n</li>\n<li>feat: support CFG parallelism for Qwen Image Edit by @pds-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/788\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/788</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Perf] LTX2.5: balance decode ranks using tile volume based cost proxy by @lauri9 in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/791\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/791</a>\n</li>\n<li>Enable FP8 communications with AITER MHA v4 by @ksikiric in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/792\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/792</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update CODEOWNERS list by @avjves in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/793\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/793</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Perf] FastH3: faster and compilable VSA-H3 attention by @jjuvonen-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/794\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/794</a>\n</li>\n<li>FastH3 V1 Dense model variant runner support by @jjuvonen-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/796\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/796</a>\n</li>\n<li>[AMD] Let dense AITER MHA v4 backends serve trailing-padded packed sequences by @jjuvonen-amd in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/797\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/797</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">New Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-new-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: New Contributors\" href=\"#new-contributors\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>@Anai-Guo made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/776\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/776</a>\n</li>\n<li>@zjn20030811 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/774\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/774</a>\n</li>\n<li>@lavinal712 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/785\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/pull/785</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/compare/0.6.0...0.7.0\">https://github.com/xdit-project/xDiT/compare/0.6.0...0.7.0</a></p>\n","assets":[]}}